            <desc_content>
                <paragraph>A target-wrapper that adds pydantic parsing to the target.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>This can be passed to <literal classes="xref py py-obj">instantiate</literal> as a <literal classes="xref py py-obj">_target_wrapper_</literal> to add pydantic parsing
                    to the (recursive) instantiation of the target.</paragraph>
